        "subject": "LU-20518 tests: skip sanity-pcc quota tests without format",
        "message": "LU-20518 tests: skip sanity-pcc quota tests without format\n\nsanity-pcc 10a to 10f set up user or group quota on a loop\nmounted ext4 device on the PCC agent. When the agent kernel lacks the\nquota format module (quota_v2 is shipped separately by some distros,\nsuch as Ubuntu 24.04), quotaon fails with \"Quota format not supported\nin kernel\" and the test fails, though nothing under test is wrong.\n\nSkip with skip_env when quotaon reports that error and keep failing on\nany other quotaon error.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-pcc\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I83068dfa733d216c768a34730b0e059f538c33b7\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
      "description": "Edit commit message"
    }
